; Argentum's arrangement, not a generic game layout. The console runs across the
; top with the minimap beside it, the game viewport sits below, and the
; character panel fills the right edge.
;
; The side panel is a single baked background image (panel_bg.png) with the
; live controls positioned on top of it, landing in the holes the artwork
; already draws. Every offset below was measured by connected-component
; labelling **on the baked 525x962 PNG itself**, not on a larger source that
; then needed scaling — so there is no conversion factor left to get wrong,
; and they stay correct exactly as long as that image and this size agree.
; Re-measuring after an art change is the recipe in OPERACION.md §3.
;
;   0                                838      1088            1613
;   +----------------------------------+--------+---------------+  0
;   | consola                          | minimapa | panel        |
;   +----------------------------------+--------+ (imagen +     |  130
;   |                                           |  controles    |
;   |          viewport 1088x832                |  encima)      |
;   |     17x13 tiles de 32px, escala 2x        |               |
;   |                                           |               |
;   +-------------------------------------------+---------------+  962
;
; Cosmetics still live in hud.gd; this file holds structure and position only.

